	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『機動戦士ガンダムNT』に登場するナラティブガンダム第３の装備を再現！",
			"• 初回生産分のみ、『機動戦士ガンダムNT』を振り返る特別冊子を封入！",
			"• ナラティブガンダムのC装備を新規造形パーツにより再現。",
			"• パーツ分けにより腹部のコア・ファイターや脚部の色分けを再現。ユニコーンガンダムを想起させる意匠を全身に纏っている。",
			"• C装備で初めて装備するビーム・ライフル、サイコフレーム付属のシールドをセット。左右の握り手に加え、武器持ち用の右手パーツも付属。",
			"• コロニー内での戦闘時、NT-D発動状態の赤いデュアルアイを再現するシールが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Reproduce the third narrative Gundam equipment that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam NT\"!",
			"• Only the first production will include a special booklet looking back on \"Mobile Suit GundamNT\"!",
			"• Narrative Gundam's C equipment is reproduced with new molded parts.",
			"• By dividing the parts, the core fighter of the abdomen and the color coding of the legs are reproduced. The entire body is decorated with a design reminiscent of the unicorn Gundam.",
			"• Beam rifle equipped for the first time with C equipment, Seal with psycho frame included. In addition to the left and right hand grips, a right hand part for holding a weapon is also included.",
			"• Comes with a Seal that reproduces the red dual eyes when NT-D is activated during battles within the colony."
		]
	},
